'''Snowy''' is an [[uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2015 Christmas Knife Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2015|2015 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its features include a snowy white forest and a snow hill on the face of the knife with a blue decorative guard, and a blue handle with a jingle bell decorated with some holly leaves and a golden bow on the bottom of the handle.

== Trivia== 
*It partners with the gun [[Nutcracker]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Nutcracker_Set Nutcracker Set].

